  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NORHED II Coastal Marine Resources ECOGIV</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Full project title: Ecosystem-based management of coastal marine resources (ECOGIV). Marine Resource Economic analysis is a disciplinary approach well suited to analyse economic development and sustainable ecosystem-based management, and recommend policies in relation to these challenges. EcoGIV will develop high level Marine Resource Economics competence for South partners by developing an open international PhD program at NTU.</narrative>
  </description>
